  "name": "smlfmt",
  "description": "A high-performance, configurable code formatter for Standard ML designed for large-scale projects and automated CI workflows. It features a complete SML parser compliant with the formal definition and SuccessorML extensions, integrated with an advanced pretty-printing engine for idiomatic code generation. The system supports full-project formatting via ML Basis (.mlb) files and provides robust error diagnostics with visual code references.",
